'''Naval Station Maracaxá''' ({{lang-bl|Estacion naval Maracaxá}}) is a [[Confederal Navy]] base in [[Maracaju]], [[Pindorama]]. It forms part of [[Joint Base Maracaxá]], an [[W:Joint base|amalgamated military base]], alongside [[Maracaxá Air Base]].

